Sort through the @dried pinto beans{1%pound} and discard of any rocks or pebble fragments, rinse and transfer to the #slow cooker{}.

Add the @thick-cut bacon{4%slices}(diced), @yellow onion{1}(diced), @chili powder{2%tablespoons}, @Kosher salt{1%tablespoon}, @black pepper{1/2%teaspoon}, and @ground cumin{1/2%teaspoon}. Stir and cover with @water{6%cups}.

> Kosher salt ONLY

Place the lid on the slow cooker and cook on high for ~{5-6%hours}. Serve and enjoy!